# Claude Code session state and scratch notes -- not part of the submission.
.claude/
claude_log/

# Every Markdown file at the repository ROOT is an internal note except the
# README, which is the documentation the Data Availability statement points to.
# A pattern rather than a list, so a new scratch file cannot be committed by
# accident.  Subdirectory READMEs and the vendored achemso LICENSE are tracked.
/*.md
!/README.md

# Publisher PDFs fetched for the citation audit; not ours to redistribute.
References/

